spans.s:
The same, one and the same, identical;
[]
 एकान्वयो मम Ś. 7; मनस्येकं वचस्येकं कर्मण्येकं महात्मनाम्

Little. Oft. used in the middle of comp. in the sense of ‘only’, with
 an adjectival or adverbial force; दोषैकदृक् looking only to faults;
 त्वदेकेषु

one substitute for two or more
letters (got by either dropping one vowel, or by the blending of both);
as the आ in एकायन.

+ -जातीय a. of the same kind, species or family. {@˚अनुसमयः@}
 performance of one detail with reference to all things or persons, then
 doing the second, then the third and so on (see पदार्थानुसमय)

The eleventh day of every fortnight of a lunar month, sacred to Viṣṇu;
 (when fasting is enjoined and is considered to be productive of great
 religious merit).
